    <description>Final real end-to-end test of the Nexus-generic paywalled mechanism, now that a real Nexus instance (Docker) is running and NEXUS_GENERIC_READ_TOKEN is configured as a repo secret. A real file has already been uploaded to this exact path (demo-app-2.0.0.exe). This should let test-internal-packages.yml's real AU force-test actually resolve version 2.0.0 from the real Nexus instance instead of failing on a placeholder.</description>
